# BAS S-RcdTop: disjoint single-field closed records are the input to the S-RcdTop rule.
# Type::is_subtype triggers check_s_rcd_top when a Union of closed single-field Records
# with different field names is encountered — such a union is semantically equivalent to Top.
# This test verifies the eval-layer behavior for the disjoint-record shapes that S-RcdTop reasons about.
[f: [fn [let r] r]
 r1: [f [x: 42]]
 r2: [f [y: "hello"]]]
=== out
Dict({"f": Function(r), "r1": Dict({"x": Int(42)}), "r2": Dict({"y": String("hello")})})
